From c9f82a60ef612320a84787b4beb881b8a7932d4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicole Muzzin <nicole@muzz.in>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:41:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] selection: honour user-select like Blink

Presses in user-select: none content neither start nor clear a selection,
drags and Shift-extension stop at the nearest selectable position,
user-select: all selects its outermost element as a whole, and none text
is neither painted as selected nor included in Selection.toString().
Editable content stays selectable. Sites set user-select: none on buttons
and navigation, which clicking used to select.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
